{"ticker":{"symbol":"313760.KQ","name":"캐리","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":468.0,"change_pct":0.0,"market_cap":5197513728.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":440.0,"week52_high":2095.0,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"South Korea","city":"Yongin-si","employees":null,"website":"https://www.willings.co.kr","business_summary":"Carry Co., Ltd. engages in the manufacture and sale of power conversion systems in South Korea. It operates through Renewable Energy and Power Solution divisions. The company offers photovoltaic inverters, ESS PCS, EPC for photovoltaic system; and power solutions, including induction heating inverters, battery pack, and PCS for ballast water management and water purifier systems. It also develops and produces rice cookers. The company was formerly known as Willings Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Carry Co., Ltd. in March 2024. The company was founded in 2003 and is headquartered in Yongin-si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"캐리(주)는 한국에서 전력 변환 시스템을 제조 및 판매하는 회사입니다. 재생에너지 및 전력 솔루션 사업부를 통해 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 태양광 인버터, ESS PCS, 태양광 시스템용 EPC를 제공합니다. 유도가열 인버터, 배터리 팩, 평형수 관리용 PCS, 정수기 시스템 등의 전력 솔루션을 보유하고 있습니다. 밥솥도 개발, 생산하고 있다. 회사는 이전에 Willings Co., Ltd.로 알려졌으며 2024년 3월에 Carry Co., Ltd.로 상호를 변경했습니다. 이 회사는 2003년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 용인시에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"산업기계","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":52319150710.0,"operating_income":-12704679370.0,"net_income":-13923340010.0,"eps":-2575.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":8381123010.0,"operating_income":-3951553670.0,"net_income":-17569623260.0,"eps":-3075.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":8174064950.0,"operating_income":-3618125580.0,"net_income":-13005957030.0,"eps":-1892.0},{"period":"2025","revenue":7481352960.0,"operating_income":-375722